i><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\" movablelimits=\"true\">det</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>18.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
